* Transistor Q1
Q1 2 6 2 NPN

* Transistor Q2
Q2 3 3 3 NPN

* Resistors
RD1 6 2 1k
RD2 3 3 1k
R1 2 0 1k
R2 3 0 1k
Ro 3 0 1k

* Voltage Sources
Vi 1 0 DC 1V
Vd1 6 2 DC 1V

* Connections
* Vi + connects to 1, Vi - connects to Ground
* RD1 connects between node 6 and node 2
* RD2 connects between node 3 and node 3
* Ro connects between node 3 and Ground
* Vd1 connects between node 6 and 2